    "bitcoin_integration": "Minimal/no formal crypto policy. The new CBI programme (Decreto-Lei n.º 07/2025 under Nationality Law n.º 07/2022) requires the USD 90,000+ contribution to be made into the National Transformation Fund's bank account, nominally in US dollars (the national currency is the dobra, STN). In September 2025 the CIU announced a partnership to make the program 'the world's first blockchain-enabled citizenship-by-investment program' (a technical/process innovation), and crypto assets are accepted as PROOF OF SOURCE OF FUNDS - but there is no official government stance on Bitcoin as policy, and neither Bitcoin nor crypto is legal tender."
